SCOPE. This licence covers the prose of the catalogue: rule records in
`rules/**`, the showcase, the charter, the contributor guide, and the document
templates in `templates/*.md`.

The executable part — `scripts/**`, `tests/**`, `.github/workflows/**` and the
executable templates — is under the MIT licence, see LICENSE-CODE. Creative
Commons does not recommend its licences for software, and the templates here
are meant to be taken and run.

DATA FROM CONSUMERS. The catalogue quotes consumers' answers verbatim in its
summary and pictures, always naming the project it came from. The terms on
which a consumer publishes that answer are stated in the consumption contract,
`export/README.md`.
